Looking at the code, the cleared range is `[fromIndex, toIndex)`. The assertion needs to express that any bit index outside this range (but still valid, i.e. nonnegative) keeps its previous value.

<code>assert \forall int i; i>=0 && (i<fromIndex || i>=toIndex); this.get(i) == \old(this.get(i));</code>
